{#
 Detail of the « activate_public » step of the Année scoute workflow (chantier #930).
 Receives `step` (Core\ScoutYear\Step\TransitionStep) and reads only
 `step.details`, `step.pendingMessage` and the step itself — the points to
 check, the actions and who marked the step are rendered by the page
 around this file, never here. Owned by the step checks (lot E); the page
 and the Détails dialog that include it are not.
#}
{% if step.details.blockers is defined and step.details.blockers is not empty %}
<ul class="small mb-2">
    {% for blocker in step.details.blockers %}
    {% set resolution_url = blocker.resolutionUrl(step.targetYearId) %}
    <li>
        {{ blocker.message(step.details.target_label) }}
        {% if resolution_url %}<a href="{{ resolution_url }}">{{ blocker.resolutionLabel(step.details.target_label) }}</a>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
<p class="text-body-secondary small mb-2">La bascule reste manuelle, sans date programmée.</p>
